id: pm-ado-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T21:41:18.830Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-16T11:09:24.092Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T21:41:23.187Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T21:49:40.538Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 43/43, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-15T00:16:09.690Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 audit found release-copy remnants or package-level regression tests needing restoration. Keep the pinned caller and package hooks; remove obsolete local release orchestration and stale references, restore independent package behavior tests, and retarget mutation proofs to the caller contract. Run touched tests, unchanged coverage gates, typecheck and lint, then regenerate and check the changelog after final tracker writes. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread actions."
  "2026-11-15T01:00:08.431Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/110: Restored five independent package tests: both before/after-tag changelog membership cases, breaking-change flags, and the two child-preloader regressions. Kept the six caller contracts. Targeted tests passed 11/11. Full npm run coverage certification is delegated to exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds. npm run typecheck passed. Both restored real-tracker membership tests pass; removing only --all-release-tags makes both fail on Unreleased placement. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker, keeping run artefacts outside this tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker write. CI must verify the pushed head; no merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-15T02:45:50.107Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 CI follow-up: canonical tag lookup can return unverified-offline. The old inline-publisher success-message assertion then fails despite a valid caller. Update the package attestation test to assert structured recognition, require an explicit deferral without an attestation claim offline, and preserve all refusal checks. Prove it with forced offline execution in a disposable Git fixture; keep coverage source inventory and thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-11-15T02:52:34.325Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 attestation follow-up: targeted tests passed 19/19, including the retained caller and package behavior contracts. Forced offline verification explicitly reports unverified-offline and defers attestation; it never claims verified provenance. In a disposable Git fixture, the fixed assertion passes, reverting only to the old assertion fails, and restoring the fix passes. Unattested-publish refusal checks remain intact. Typecheck passed; coverage source inventory and thresholds remain unchanged. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final write. Exact pushed-head npm/Bun coverage and release certification remain CI gates. No merge, release dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-15T02:54:59.122Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 attestation follow-up: targeted tests passed 19/19, including the retained caller and package behavior contracts. Forced offline verification explicitly reports unverified-offline and defers attestation; it never claims verified provenance. In a disposable Git fixture, the fixed assertion passes, reverting only to the old assertion fails, and restoring the fix passes. Unattested-publish refusal checks remain intact. Typecheck passed; coverage source inventory and thresholds remain unchanged. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final write. Exact pushed-head npm/Bun coverage and release certification remain CI gates. No merge, release dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-16T09:14:56.023Z",pi-claude,"Stalled-PR recovery. Root cause of all four failing checks (test 22, test 26, release gate npm, release gate bun): the tracker item's linked test command used a single-quoted --test-name-pattern value, and the portable-grouping audit accepts only closed double-quoted patterns without shell expansion (single quotes are metacharacter syntax on cmd.exe). Replaced the recorded command with the double-quoted portable form; no source change was needed. Verified with the process-fixture audit itself, which now passes locally. No test coverage was removed: the release-caller contract suite and attestation refusal checks are unchanged."
  "2026-11-16T10:39:56.741Z",codex-sol,Resuming the existing PR at f7f422d after provider handoff. Both current CI Node jobs pass. The earlier portability thread is fixed by f7f422d. A remaining valid review identifies saved child-preloader and breaking-change tests still linked to release-workflow.test.ts after moving their implementations to changelog-content.test.ts. Repair the existing links with tracker history and prove they execute the intended tests.
  "2026-11-16T10:57:53.573Z",codex-sol,"Post-install validation exposed a real concurrency failure in the selected-test deadline audit: recursive enumeration followed the live preload fixture symlink into temporary storage and failed when another fixture disappeared. Restrict source inventory to Git-tracked TypeScript under test and scripts; assert the moved preload source remains included and the live adversarial source remains excluded. No package source or coverage threshold changes. The initial run overlapped npm ci and is discarded; fresh membership tests pass."
  "2026-11-16T11:00:48.860Z",codex-sol,Saved breaking-change command passes through pm test with one executed test. The corrected saved preloader command now executes its intended regression and reaches the unchanged 300-second wrapper timeout under shared-host load; tracked on existing pm-ado-ci-wrapper-child-timeout. Fresh before/after-tag membership tests pass 2/2. Caller and attestation tests pass; the initial portability suite exposed the fixture-symlink inventory race being repaired separately in this PR.
  "2026-11-16T11:08:40.639Z",codex-sol,"Validation after the source-inventory fix: caller, attestation and process-fixture suite passes 24/24; linked deadline/portable-grouping audit passes 2/2; fresh before/after-tag membership tests pass 2/2; linked breaking-change regression executes and passes 1/1. Typecheck and generated changelog check pass. The full quick npm suite is still running and has reported the unchanged preloader child deadline failure; existing pm-ado-ci-wrapper-child-timeout records that blocker. No lint script is configured. Full release certification cannot be claimed within twenty minutes while its prerequisite suite exceeds that duration. Both review findings are addressed: f7f422d already corrected quote portability, and this continuation replaces the two stale saved commands and the saved breaking-change path. Main dependency conflicts retain exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 and yaml while preserving main CI. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread actions."
